# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's barracks (stage 5m): the third level, inside. A hall in its middle, a guard at its post
# watching its south door; round the hall a corridor, a guard going round it; past the corridor, rooms on
# both sides, dark, a door each: where one waits while the round goes by. The way out, north, lit. A
# scroll in the north-west room, and one in the hall, behind its guard's back. Drawn as a plan
# (plans/level-3.plan).
title The barracks
spawn 0 1 -2
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.1
sky 22.0

plan -18 -40
